cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "datawise-os-integration: configurable data gates for building and energy telemetry"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Stamatopoulos"
    given-names: "Stathis"
    email: "sstamatopoulos@epu.ntua.gr"
    affiliation: "ICCS"
  - name: "ICCS"
abstract: >-
  Apache Airflow pipelines that land telemetry from building and energy systems,
  including legacy field protocols, historians and file exports, in a FIWARE
  Orion-LD context broker and InfluxDB, following the FIWARE Smart Data Models.
  A source is configured in YAML; twenty-four gate types are built in.
keywords:
  - FIWARE
  - NGSI-LD
  - InfluxDB
  - Apache Airflow
  - smart buildings
  - energy data
  - BACnet
  - Modbus
  - OPC UA
  - data integration
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/sstamatopoulos/datawise-os-integration"
